    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d827">

                <pb facs="0772" n="760" xml:id="pg760"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00111 A.R./1036: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-08T15:00:00-03:00">May 8, 1940—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 8—2:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>196. Buenos Aires telegram No. 127, May 7, 6 p.m. Aranha tells me that he has
                    taken no action and is awaiting a reply to my telegram No. 189, May 1, 2
                    p.m.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Buenos Aires.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
